comment1.text=\r\n\ Constructor\r\n\ Crea\ un\ simbolo\ shy\ con\ el\ color\ dado,\ empezando\ visible\r\n\r\n\ @param\ color\ que\ es\ un\ String\ que\ es\ el\ color\ CSS\ de\ este\ simbolo\r\n
